'''A Colossal Valentine's''' (バレンタイン強襲！, ''Balentain Kyōshū！'', '''Valentine Assault!''') is a valentines stage added in [[Version 10.2 Update|Version 10.2]]. This [[Gauntlet]] features a new enemy known as [[Chocolate Doge]].

==Overview==
===About===
A Colossal Valentine's contains a total of 20 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Choco Chaos Lvs''' (Choco Chaos Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a Choco Chaos can include XP, [[Catfruit]], [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], [[Ototo Corps|Materials]] and [[Cat Energy|Leaderships]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[A Colossal Valentine's/Choco Chaos Lv.1~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*A Colossal Valentine's is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1.

